            <div xml:id="ch74">

                <pb facs="0397" n="315" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg315"/>

                <head>Treaty and protocol between the United States and Japan—Commerce and
                    navigation</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, February 21, 1911.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ratification advised by the Senate, with amendment,
                        February 24, 1911.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ratified by the President, March 2, 1911.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ratified by Japan, March 31, 1911.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ratifications exchanged at Tokyo, April 4, 1911.</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Proclaimed April 5, 1911.</hi></p>


